    "detailed_description": "Slide Ball Master is a new puzzle game with unique gameplay where you shoot bricks with your slingshot. With Carom's billiard-like gameplay, it's very important to calculate your shot. If you like billiards and hitting bricks, this game is for you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FUN AND CHALLENGING BLOCKS</h2>Does it seem easy to just hit the block? With so many different types of blocks, just hitting is not enough. For example, if you hit the red crossed blocks, the game is over!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW TO PLAY</h2>Click and drag on the \u200bscreen to form a trajectory. Release touch to shoot and slide the ball.<br><br><br>- 7 Chapters and 90 Levels<br>- Finish all levels and get Slide Ball Master achievement",
